  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Set a frying pan over <b>medium-low</b> heat and lay the sandwich in.</li><li>Cover it. Cook about 3–4 minutes, until the underside is deep golden and the cheese at the edge has started to slump.</li><li>Take the lid off, flip once, and cook the second side 2–3 minutes, uncovered, until it matches.</li></ul>",
   "heat": {
